  "summary": {
    "text": "Student life outside the classroom runs through elected student bodies rather than a single council. BRCA coordinates eleven clubs spanning dance, drama, music, debate, quizzing, design and fine arts, and stages the cultural fest Rendezvous each October. CAIC hosts technical clubs such as DevClub and Robotics Club plus several departmental societies, and organises Tryst, the institute's annual science-and-technology festival held in February-March. BSA runs competitive and recreational sport across fourteen disciplines, from athletics and swimming to weightlifting, alongside an entrepreneurship cell and a community-service wing.",
